<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>No. 1 Obsession</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">5 Seconds of Summer</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">EVERYONE'S A STAR! (Fully Evolved)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5enE6FKFZzS2nNKpOfy5eU</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.065" end="00:11.032">I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.032" end="00:14.472">I know that boys don't cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.472" end="00:17.961">But I got teary eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.961" end="00:22.199">Oh, baby, can you sympathise? (Sympathise, sympathise)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.199" end="00:23.699" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.840" end="00:24.836">Please</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.836" end="00:28.318">Just tell me it's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.318" end="00:31.695">And tell me I'm your type</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.695" end="00:35.976">I'll keep your hunger satisfied (Satisfied, satisfied)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.976" end="00:37.476" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.026" end="00:39.455">Everything I need's right here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.455" end="00:42.884">Everything I see, right here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.884" end="00:44.663">In your reflection</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.663" end="00:50.599">God, you make me feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.599" end="00:52.099" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.703" end="00:57.526">Crush me with the sunshine of your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.526" end="01:03.750">Shine a light on all my darkest parts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.750" end="01:05.349">Take me to heaven</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.349" end="01:07.162">Kill the depression</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.162" end="01:10.642">Make me your number one obsession</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.642" end="01:12.421">Take me to heaven</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.421" end="01:14.125">Kill the depression</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.125" end="01:17.624">Make me your number one obsession</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.624" end="01:19.124" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.400" end="01:20.099">I can't fall asleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.099" end="01:21.987">It's like I'm in a dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.987" end="01:23.684">Lucid energy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.684" end="01:25.325">Taking over me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.325" end="01:27.809">I'm dying for a little bit of your affection</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.809" end="01:31.620">I'd do anything to be the only one that you think of</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.620" end="01:33.120" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.420" end="01:39.245">Crush me with the sunshine of your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.245" end="01:45.397">Shine a light on all my darkest parts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.397" end="01:47.169">Take me to heaven</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.169" end="01:48.905">Kill the depression</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.905" end="01:52.408">Make me your number one obsession</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.408" end="01:54.030">Take me to heaven</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.030" end="01:55.814">Kill the depression</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.814" end="01:59.395">Make me your number one obsession</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.395" end="02:03.653" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.653" end="02:10.563">Save me from the dark</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.563" end="02:17.212">Sunshine of your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.212" end="02:24.440">Come save me from the dark</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.440" end="02:28.945">Sunshine of your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.945" end="02:31.448" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.448" end="02:38.399">Crush me with the sunshine of your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.399" end="02:44.560">Shine a light on all my darkest parts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.560" end="02:46.243">Take me to heaven</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.243" end="02:48.006">Kill the depression</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.006" end="02:51.454">Make me your number one obsession</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.454" end="02:53.198">Take me to heaven</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.198" end="02:54.984">Kill the depression</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.984" end="02:58.984">Make me your number one obsession (Obsession)</p></div></body></tt>